<![CDATA[<div style="font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><br>Case {!Case.CaseNumber}'s current SLA is 4 hours from being missed.</b></div><div><br><b>To view the case please: <a href="{!$Label.Core_IPS_Notification_Internal_URL}/{!Case.Id}">Click Here</a></b><br><br><b>{!Case(Case.Core_IPS_Notif_Case_Comment__c,1, "This message was designed such that it contains no information which may be considered confidential.",2, "No comments have been added to this case.",3, "Latest Public Comment*",4, "Latest Private Comment*","")}</b><br>{!Case(Case.Core_IPS_Notif_Case_Comment__c,1, "",2, "",3, Case.Core_Last_Case_Comment__c,4, Case.Core_Last_Private_Case_Comment__c,"")}<br><b>{!Case(Case.Core_IPS_Notif_Case_Comment__c,1, "",2, "",3, "Submitted by: ",4, "Submitted by: ","")}</b>{!Case(Case.Core_IPS_Notif_Case_Comment__c,1, "",2, "",3, Case.Core_Last_Case_Comment_Submitter__c,4, Case.Core_Last_Private_Case_Comment_Submitter__c,"")}<br><br><div align="center"><b>_______________________________________________________________</b><br></div><br><div align="center"><b>Case Details</b><br></div><br><b>{!if(Case.Core_IPS_Restricted_Secret_Content__c,"","Subject:")}</b><br>{!if(Case.Core_IPS_Restricted_Secret_Content__c,"",Case.Subject)}<br><b>{!if(Case.Core_IPS_Restricted_Secret_Content__c,"","Description: ")}</b><br>{!if(Case.Core_IPS_Restricted_Secret_Content__c,"",Case.Core_Issue_Description__c)}<br><br><font size="2"><b>Case Number:</b> {!Case.CaseNumber}<br><b>Status{!if(ispickval(Case.Core_Sub_Status__c,""),": "," - Sub Status: ")}</b>{!Case.Status}{!if(ispickval(Case.Core_Sub_Status__c,""),""," - ")}{!Case.Core_Sub_Status__c}<br><b>Case Owner: </b>{!Case.OwnerFullName}<br><b>Case Co-Owner: </b>{!Case.Core_Case_Co_Owner__c}<br><b>Last Assigned Queue:</b> {!Case.Core_IPS_Assigned_Queue__c}<br><b>Priority - Severity:</b> {!Case.Priority} - {!Case.Core_Severity__c}<br><b>Product - Organization:</b> {!Case.Core_IPS_Product_name__c} - {!Case.Core_Product_Organization__c}<br><b>Contact - Account: </b>{!Case.Contact} - {!Case.Account}<br><b>{!if(isblank(Case.Core_Case_Issue_Category__c),"",if(isblank(Case.Core_External_Issue_Subcategory__c),"Category: ","Category - Sub Category: "))}</b>{!if(isblank(Case.Core_Case_Issue_Category__c),"",Case.Core_External_Issue_Category__c)}{!if(isblank(Case.Core_Case_Issue_Sub_Category__c),""," - ")}{!if(isblank(Case.Core_Case_Issue_Sub_Category__c),"",Case.Core_External_Issue_Subcategory__c)}<br><b>{!if(isblank(Case.Core_IPS_Project_Case__c),"","Project: ")}</b>{!Case.Core_IPS_Project_Case__c}</font><br><br><div align="center"><font color="#666666"><b>_______________________________________________________________</b></font><br></div><font color="#666666"><div><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 7.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">* Inline images have been removed from this email. &nbsp;Please open in&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Intel®&nbsp;Premier Support to view all images.</span></div><br><font size="1">This message contains Intel Confidential information and should be handled in accordance with your Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) with Intel. Access to this e-mail by anyone other than the intended recipient is unauthorized. If you are not the intended recipient (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not use, copy, distribute, or deliver this message or any part of its contents or take any action in reliance on it, and in such case, you should destroy this message.<br><br>Copyright ©Intel Corporation. All rights reserved. Intel Corporation, 2200 Mission College Blvd., M/S RNB4-145, Santa Clara, CA 95054-1549 USA www.intel.com (408) 765-8080</font></font><br></div>]]></td>
